### Issue description

When calling `OptionButton.GetItemIndex(int val)` with val = `-1`  returns -1 regardless of the button having an  entry with '-1' as id.

This is a bug as neither the `OptionButton` class documentation or either  the `GetItemIndex`/`AddItem` method documentations mention this behaviour.

Expected behaviour: OptionButton.GetItemIndex(-1) returns the index of the item with '-1' as id if there is one, and -1  otherwise.

